This project is an independent TypeScript implementation of the server layer
described by the Aegra project (https://github.com/aegra/aegra), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No source code from Aegra is
included here; the design and the protocol surface it implements informed this
work, and the acknowledgement is offered in that spirit.

The HTTP surface implemented here is the Agent Protocol, defined by LangChain
(https://github.com/langchain-ai/agent-protocol). Graph execution, checkpointing
and the client used in the compatibility tests are provided by the LangGraph
packages (https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraphjs), which are separately
licensed. Those packages are dependencies and are not redistributed here.

